<h1>Alert</h1>
<p>The <code>&lt;app-alert&gt;</code> component displays an important, contextual message to the
  user. It supports four severity levels and an optional dismiss button.</p>

<h2>Examples</h2>

<h3>Info (default)</h3>
<app-alert>This is a default informational alert.</app-alert>
{% highlight "html" %}
<app-alert>This is a default informational alert.</app-alert>
{% endhighlight %}

<h3>Success</h3>
<app-alert alert-type="success" heading="Success">Your changes have been saved.</app-alert>
{% highlight "html" %}
<app-alert alert-type="success" heading="Success">Your changes have been saved.</app-alert>
{% endhighlight %}

<h3>Warning</h3>
<app-alert alert-type="warning" heading="Important notice">Please review before continuing.</app-alert>
{% highlight "html" %}
<app-alert alert-type="warning" heading="Important notice">Please review before continuing.</app-alert>
{% endhighlight %}

<h3>Danger, dismissible</h3>
<app-alert alert-type="danger" heading="Error" dismissible>Something went wrong.</app-alert>
{% highlight "html" %}
<app-alert alert-type="danger" heading="Error" dismissible>Something went wrong.</app-alert>
{% endhighlight %}
